3400 HOME:INVERSE:PRINT "OUR STORY THUS FAR...":NORMAL
3401 PRINT"  A CLOAKED BORG CUBE IS BEARING DOWN ON";
3402 PRINT"THE CHANDRA SYSTEM. THE FIFTH PLANET IS"
3403 PRINT"HOME TO  BRILLIANT AND PEACEFUL SPECIES"
3404 PRINT"THAT HAS MASTERED NAVIGATING THE"
3405 PRINT"INFINITE 'MYCELIAL NETWORK'. THE BORG"
3406 PRINT"MUST NOT ASSIMILATE THIS CLOSELY-GUARDED";
3407 PRINT"KNOWLEDGE, AND THE CHANDRANS CANNOT"
3408 PRINT"DEFEND THEMSELVES. IT IS UP TO YOU TO"
3409 PRINT"SAVE THEM, AND THE GALAXY.  YOUR SHUTTLE";
