3411 PRINT"SECTION 31, THE 'BLACK OPS' ARM OF"
3412 PRINT"STARFLEET. YOU HAVE TWO MULTIPHASIC"
3413 PRINT"TORPEDOES AND A SHIELD SYSTEM. THE"
3414 PRINT"SHUTTLE ALSO POSSESSES A LIMITED"
3415 PRINT"MYCELIAL 'JUMP DRIVE.'"
