3502 PRINT"CUBE WILL MOVE RELENTLESSLY TOWARD THE"
3503 PRINT"PLANET, IT WILL SOMETIMES FEINT: ZIG AND";
3504 PRINT"ZAG, MAYBE HOLD POSITION, ALL TO DECEIVE";
3505 PRINT"ANY POSSIBLE PURSUER...SUCH AS YOU. YOUR";
3506 PRINT"BEST CHANCE TO SAVE THE CHANDRANS IS TO"
3507 PRINT"FIND THE CUBE EARLY IN YOUR MISSION, SO"
3508 PRINT"YOU HAVE A SMALL MARGIN FOR ERROR. BUT"
