3603 PRINT"SOMEWHERE ON THE OUTER RIM, AND"
3604 PRINT"METHODICALLY WORK ITS WAY TOWARD THE"
3605 PRINT"PLANET AT 0,0. USE THE A-W-S-D KEYS TO"
3606 PRINT"MOVE THE JUMP CROSSHAIR ONCE THE"
3607 PRINT"'CURRENT SECTOR' IS DISPLAYED, AND THEN"
3608 PRINT"'PRESS J TO ENGAGE"
