3613 NORMAL:PRINT " FOR THE NEXT SCREEN. ";:GET A$

3700 HOME:INVERSE:PRINT "GAME PLAY (CONT'D)":NORMAL
3701 PRINT"  ONE PROBLEM IS THAT WHEN YOU JUMP, THE";
3702 PRINT"CUBE MOVES ALSO, SO YOU HAVE TO"
3703 PRINT"ANTICIPATE WHERE IT WILL GO NEXT. UNLESS";
3704 PRINT"YOU'RE VERY LUCKY, IT WILL TAKE TWO"
3705 PRINT"SUCCESSFUL HITS TO DISABLE THE CUBE."
3706 PRINT"UNFORTUNATELY, THE BORG POSSESS SUPERIOR";
3707 PRINT"WEAPONS. YOU HAVE THE OPTION OF"
3708 PRINT"RETURNING TO CHANDRA V TO RELOAD AND"
3709 PRINT"REPAIR, BUT REMEMBER: THE CUBE WILL HAVE";
3710 PRINT"MOVED *TWICE* IF YOU MUST JUMP TO THE"
3711 PRINT"STATION, ONCE WHEN YOU GO AND AGAIN WHEN";
3712 PRINT"YOU DEPART. IF YOU WISH TO REMAIN IN"
3713 PRINT"YOUR CURRENT SECTOR, DON'T MOVE THE"
3714 PRINT"CROSSHAIR - JUST PRESS J."
3715 VTAB 24:FLASH:? "PRESS ANY KEY";
3716 NORMAL:PRINT " FOR THE NEXT SCREEN. ";:GET A$

