3802 PRINT"WILL APPEAR SOMEWHERE IN THE OUTER PART"
3803 PRINT"OF THE QUADRANT NO MORE THAN TWO GRIDS"
3804 PRINT"IN. THE CHANCE OF A PERFECT SHOT IS 10%,";
