3806 PRINT"MOVE ONE GRID (OR NONE) AT A TIME -"
3807 PRINT"VERTICALLY, HORIZONTALLY, OR DIAGONALLY"
3808 PRINT"- DUE TO THE CAPTAIN'S EXPERIENCE WITH"
