3814 PRINT"65% CHANCE OF A HIT, BUT THE CUBE WILL"
3815 PRINT"MOVE 0, 1, OR 2 GRIDS AT A TIME. THIS"
3816 PRINT"REFLECTS THE YOUNG PILOT'S REFLEXES AND"
3817 PRINT"DARING, BUT LACK OF EXPERIENCE."
